DATA interfaces and first actual boundary
------------------------------------------

prepare_plan.py reads actual future adopted arrays and an explicit Root
input theorem.  The theorem's consumer_stage, exact operand_roles and
mathematical_imports must all agree with the binding.  It emits unapproved
templates whose status and authorization flags prevent execution.  Finite
plans/releases are capped8KiB; partner plans32KiB and releases16KiB.  The
Root must independently review Source, exact current arrays and original
theorem meanings before making a supported release.  Missing actual raw
maps cannot be replaced by guessed hashes or the scalar ordered-orbit count.

assemble_values.py authenticates one explicit gzip value bank, an actual
Root stage adoption and every whole old raw-body descriptor.  It copies
only already certified cells/selected records.  For witnesses it packs
already certified targets/masses into their original sparse slots.  It
does not evaluate maps or discover minima/partners/components.  Its bank
is physically at most2MiB; decoded full-body extent is capped24MiB and
ordinary RSS128MiB remains enforced.  Large logical bodies are never
presented as fresh physical reads of their historical paths.  A future
concrete bank still needs its exact constructor/read invoice and Root
review; the source does not assert such a bank already exists.

